{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\駅前.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花座り込み.gal" "WAIT" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"</STYLE>Haruka<STYLE ID="3">, are you calmer?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Haruka<STYLE ID="2">'s breathing had settled somewhat, but she was in no state to stand yet.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"N-<STYLE ID="3">Natsumi</STYLE>...
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">Natsumi</STYLE>..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Haruka<STYLE ID="2">, still sitting, gripped both my hands hard.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Haruka<STYLE ID="2">'s hands were so flushed I could not tell whether they were hot or cold, and they were sweating.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">I sat down too and brought my eyes level with </STYLE>Haruka<STYLE ID="2">'s.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"It's all right, I'm here."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Please...! Don't go to the police...!
{PAUSE ""}
　With me... be with me...!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"But, </STYLE><STYLE ID="8">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> is―"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花腕組みアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
"Please!"
{PLAYSND "SE\軽くぶつかる.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Haruka<STYLE ID="2"> threw her arms around me, careless of who saw.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"</STYLE>Haruka<STYLE ID="3">... I..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">I wanted to say I would not go anywhere, but </STYLE><STYLE ID="8">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> was at the police station.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">I could not leave that alone either.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">At the police station, </STYLE><STYLE ID="8">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Frightened at the word police, making excuses to me, </STYLE>Haruka<STYLE ID="2">.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">And that dream.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">I do not want to imagine it, but the victim this time really is...</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">Now then, should I go to the police station, or take </STYLE>Haruka<STYLE ID="2"> and run?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">This is a very important choice.</STYLE>
